Action shortcuts
These fill in uses and with for actions most workflows need. checkout fetches the repository, and fetch_depth=0 fetches its whole history rather than only the latest commit. setup_python and setup_node install a language version and cache its packages. cache saves a folder at the end of a run and restores it at the start of the next one whose key matches. upload_artifact and download_artifact pass files from one job to another, and docker_build_push builds a Docker image and, with push=True, pushes it.


