Strategy and steps
strategy() starts a matrix, and step(name) adds an empty step for you to fill in. The other methods each add one ready-made step and return it. checkout, setup_python and setup_node wrap the step shortcuts above. install and run_tests add a pip install command and a test command. setup_uv, uv_install and uv_run do the same with uv: install uv itself, run uv sync --frozen, and run a command through uv run, naming the step after the command.


